  "id": "relative-judgment",
  "term": "relative judgment",
  "definition": "Relative judgment is judging how individuals compare with one another on a skill, rather than only estimating each person’s overall level. In this context, it means how accurately a teacher can rank children within a group according to their mathematical skills.",
